# Isolated git worktrees created by Claude Code workflow agents. Transient
# scaffolding — each one is a full checkout, and none of it belongs in history.
.claude/worktrees/

# Ad-hoc measurement scratch written into the repo root by audit agents while they
# drive a local server (each one hardcodes whatever port that run used —
# _measure2.mjs was committed carrying `http://127.0.0.1:3411`, and rewrote itself
# to :3414 minutes later). Transient by construction, and useless to anyone else.
#
# `_perf.mjs` is deliberately NOT covered: it is the curated, committed perf probe
# (957e327) and it is the file a new one should be folded into.
#
# The lesson this encodes: `git add -A` is not safe while a background agent is
# writing into the working tree. Two of these were swept into 064ca6c that way.
_measure*.mjs

